    {
      "text": "Table of pooled diagnostic accuracy for detection of rifampicin resistance: 13 studies, 446 (54) participants (cases), sensitivity 100.0 (93.4 to 100.0), specificity 99.4 (92.1 to 100.0), positive predictive value 94.6 (56.7 to 100.0) and negative predictive value 100.0 (99.2 to 100.0), all with 95% CI.",
